cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "JARVIS: a personal agentic daemon (jarvisd)"
abstract: >-
  A privacy-first resident daemon for one person's machine. Version 1 is observe-only:
  it collects from a personal notes vault, a task file, local git repositories and its own
  logs, applies a tier gate before anything is read into a Claude-bound payload, and writes
  one morning digest. A local model tier, a read-only web page, a push notification, a memory
  consolidation pass and an ask command exist as adapters tested against fakes.
authors:
